// User Profile for `stock` — the neutral login user of the Pure (Stock)
// Profiles (`kde-pure`, `niri-pure`, `hyprland-pure`; ADR 0112, ADR 0157).
// Resolved over the neutral User Core, so it carries no programs and a bash
